{
 "about": "The watch app's screens (SPEC.md), each drawn from a phone state of contracts/watchface/payload/cases.json's 'app' list ('state': its index; null: nothing from the phone yet) at a watch time ('at': s after its 'now'), with the screen's own inputs ('set': payload keys replaced, for a watch state the phone's cases lack; 'cfg': 'days' the numbers' period, 'sel' the selection; the logging screens' 'kind', 'amount', 'progress' of the hold, 'dup' the same kind just logged, 'left' the share of Undo's 10 s; the mute screens' 'side', 'min', 'act'; the alert's 'spark' (the watch setting) and 'item' (which ring item); the glance's 'outbox': wait / ask / sent; 'update': app / phone, the payload read as one of a newer / older version, and the update page's 'opened'). apps/garmin/app's case loader (cases.jungle) shows them in turn; tools/watchface/app.js draws the reference from the same input.",
